@ProductManagementSystem_HostAddress = http://localhost:5281

### Get All Products
GET {{ProductManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/Product
Accept: application/json

### Get Product by Id
GET {{ProductManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/Product/2
Accept: application/json

### Create A Product
POST {{ProductManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/Product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oreo Cookie",
  "description": "Sweet Cookie Buscuit",
  "quantity": 300,
  "price": 12500
}

### Update A Product
PUT {{ProductManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/Product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Era Cap",
  "description": "Updated Snapback Cap",
  "quantity": 20,
  "price": 2500
}

### Delete product
DELETE {{ProductManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/Product/2